{"product":{"id":8448426508444,"title":"mixsoon Collagen Toner Pad 170ml (110ea)","body_html":"\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"youtube%20link%20here\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓Insert contents↓↓↓↓↓↓↓↓--\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0506\/2121\/8972\/files\/mixsoon_Collagen_Toner_Pad_170ml_110ea_-1_600x600.jpg?v=1750056971\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; float: none;\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003emixsoon Collagen Toner Pad 170ml (110ea)\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eDescription\u003c\/h4\u003e\nFirming toner pads enriched with Collagen to help improve skin elasticity. Formulated with enoki mushroom derived collagen to moisturize and rejuvenate your skin. Infused with plant-based PDRN extracted from seaweed that penetrates deeply into your skin for a healthy-looking and radiant complexion. The pads can be easily torn into 2 pieces for applying on different areas of skin.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eHow to use\u003c\/h4\u003e\nAs wiping toner: Gently wipe across the skin after cleansing to smooth skin texture and boost the effect of the next skincare product on the skin. As face mask: Apply on areas of skin that feel dry or irritated to soothe.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e \u003c!--Enter--\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIngredients\u003c\/h4\u003e\nWater, Butylene Glycol, Hydroxyethyl Urea, Niacinamide, Diethoxyethyl Succinate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Hydroxyacetophenone, Glycereth-25 PCA Isostearate, Propanediol, Hyaluronic Acid, Hydrolyzed Hyaluro